<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Perception error to AEB</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 60rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
  h1, h2 { line-height: 1.25; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid #8884; padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; text-align: left; }
  .note { border-left: 3px solid #8888; padding-left: 0.8rem; color: #666; }
  .empty { color: #888; font-style: italic; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Perception error to AEB</h1>

<p class="note">
  Every number below is there because a committed claim says it should be, and
  every claim names the artifact it rests on. The configuration groups are kept
  apart because they answer different questions: an imported calibration
  distribution is a measurement, and a single-channel severity is a choice.
</p>

<h2>Claims</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Claim</th><th>Statement</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Status</th><th>Artifact</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for claim in claims %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ claim.claim_id }}</td>
      <td>{{ claim.text }}</td>
      <td>{{ claim.evidence_type }}</td>
      <td>{{ claim.status }}</td>
      <td>{{ claim.artifact_path }}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Cohort exclusions</h2>
<p>
  {{ invalid.excluded }} scenario(s) were excluded from every configuration.
  A scenario that failed anywhere is used nowhere, so that all configurations
  are averaged over one set of roads.
</p>
{% if invalid.reasons %}
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Phase</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for phase, count in invalid.reasons | dictsort %}
    <tr><td>{{ phase }}</td><td>{{ count }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}

{% for group in groups %}
<h2>{{ group | replace("_", " ") | title }}</h2>
{% if grouped[group] %}
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Configuration</th><th>Scenarios</th><th>Collisions</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for row in grouped[group] %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ row.configuration_id }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.scenarios }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.collisions }}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">No results in this group.</p>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</body>
</html>
